      "content": "To earn the full 10 marks for a Grade 12 literary essay, you need to move beyond the literal plot. The question asks you to discuss how the speaker reflects on people's connection to nature using structure, imagery, and tone. \n\nIf we look at the poem's structure, it is a Petrarchan sonnet. How does the shift between the octave (first 8 lines) and the sestet (last 6 lines) change the focus of the speaker's reflection?"
